---
source: tests/setup.rs
expression: "plan_output(&[\"setup\", \"--plan\", \"--profile\", \"server\"])"
---
hpds setup --profile server runs these 15 steps:
  1. system libraries (apt)
       for Docker Engine, unless installed: register the Docker apt repository download.docker.com/linux/ubuntu with its signing key in /etc/apt/keyrings/docker.asc
       for R + CRAN/PPM repositories, unless installed: sudo curl -L https://rig.r-pkg.org/deb/rig.gpg -o /etc/apt/trusted.gpg.d/rig.gpg
       for R + CRAN/PPM repositories, unless installed: register the rig apt repository in /etc/apt/sources.list.d/rig.list (sudo)
       for RStudio Server, unless the installed version is current: download the latest stable RStudio Server amd64 package from Posit and verify its Debian package identity with dpkg-deb
       for code-server + extensions, unless code-server is installed: download the latest code-server amd64 package from github.com/coder/code-server releases, check it against GitHub's sha256 digest, and verify its Debian package identity with dpkg-deb
       sudo env DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive NEEDRESTART_SUSPEND=1 apt-get -o DPkg::Lock::Timeout=600 update
       if the refresh fails: remove the apt sources this run added and refresh again (their steps then install their own packages)
       sudo env DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive NEEDRESTART_SUSPEND=1 apt-get -o DPkg::Lock::Timeout=600 install -y build-essential ca-certificates curl gnupg libcurl4-openssl-dev libfontconfig1-dev libfreetype6-dev libfribidi-dev libgit2-dev libharfbuzz-dev libjpeg-dev libpng-dev libssl-dev libtiff5-dev libxml2-dev unixodbc-dev zlib1g-dev python3 python3-pip python3-venv docker-ce docker-ce-cli containerd.io docker-buildx-plugin docker-compose-plugin r-rig <verified rstudio-server package> <verified code-server package>
       if that install fails: sudo env DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive NEEDRESTART_SUSPEND=1 apt-get -o DPkg::Lock::Timeout=600 install -y build-essential ca-certificates curl gnupg libcurl4-openssl-dev libfontconfig1-dev libfreetype6-dev libfribidi-dev libgit2-dev libharfbuzz-dev libjpeg-dev libpng-dev libssl-dev libtiff5-dev libxml2-dev unixodbc-dev zlib1g-dev python3 python3-pip python3-venv (the other steps then install their own packages)
  2. Docker Engine
       if Docker Engine is still missing, install it from download.docker.com/linux/ubuntu (docker-ce docker-ce-cli containerd.io docker-buildx-plugin docker-compose-plugin); add <user> to the docker group
  3. stable Rust
       install or update stable Rust with verified rustup
  4. R + CRAN/PPM repositories
       hpds install r
       ensure the Posit Package Manager CRAN repository line is present once
  5. Python + PPM pip configuration
       sudo env DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive NEEDRESTART_SUSPEND=1 apt-get -o DPkg::Lock::Timeout=600 install -y python3 python3-pip python3-venv (unless system libraries (apt) installed them)
       sudo sh -c printf '[global]\nindex-url = https://packagemanager.posit.co/pypi/latest/simple\n' > /etc/pip.conf
  6. quarto
       hpds install quarto (latest stable)
  7. tinytex
       hpds install tinytex
  8. RStudio Server
       hpds install rstudio-server (latest stable)
  9. RStudio preferences
       merge RStudio preferences: insert_native_pipe_operator=true save_workspace=never load_workspace=never rainbow_parentheses=true rainbow_fenced_divs=true
 10. code-server + extensions
       if code-server is still missing, download and verify its package as in step 1 and install it with sudo env DEBIAN_FRONTEND=noninteractive NEEDRESTART_SUSPEND=1 apt-get -o DPkg::Lock::Timeout=600 install -y <verified code-server package>
       code-server --install-extension ms-python.python --install-extension ms-toolsai.jupyter --install-extension quarto.quarto --install-extension charliermarsh.ruff
       set quarto.path to <home>/.local/bin/quarto and systemctl enable --now code-server@<user>
 11. gh
       hpds install gh (latest stable)
 12. duckdb
       hpds install duckdb (latest stable)
 13. uv + ruff + sqlfluff
       hpds install uv (latest stable)
       uv tool install --upgrade ruff
       uv tool install --upgrade sqlfluff
       uv tool update-shell
 14. rig
       hpds install rig
 15. git defaults
       hpds git setup
